Security Note:
Passwords are set to placeholder value "postgres". In production, these should be:
1. Stored in environment variables
2. Managed through secrets management systems (AWS Secrets Manager, Azure Key Vault, etc.)
3. Never committed to version control in plain text

Connection string successfully migrated to PostgreSQL format.
